age":4,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b18","raw_text":"creatinine≧1.5mg/dL)，或具尿酸性腎臟結石或尿酸性尿路結石或痛風\n","start_char":0,"end_char":42,"bbox":[51.959999084472656,557.2860107421875,555.73681640625,573.2459716796875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b19","raw_text":"石，或肝硬化之痛風病人。（103/3/1、105/8/1、 (108/12/1）  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":43,"bbox":[51.959999084472656,587.2860107421875,516.0599975585938,603.2459716796875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b20","raw_text":"3.痛風石病人使用時需於病歷上詳細記載部位(需有照片或 X 光攝影檢查)\n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[36.0,617.3160400390625,555.8999633789062,633.2760009765625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b21","raw_text":"及醫療理由。 (108/12/1） \n","start_char":0,"end_char":19,"bbox":[51.959999084472656,647.3160400390625,251.989990234375,663.2760009765625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b22","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,677.3160400390625,43.380001068115234,693.2760009765625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b23","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,707.3160400390625,43.380001068115234,723.2760009765625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b24","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,737.3120727539062,43.380001068115234,753.2720336914062]}],"source_quality":[]}